<main class="pc" data-product-core="potential"><p class="pc-kicker">CRANIO SYSTEMS / 03 / Potential</p><h1>Zero is not the goal.</h1><p class="pc-lead">Distinguish current, desired and potential states.</p><div class="pc-steps" role="navigation" aria-label="CRANIO"><a href="../your-cranium/">01 · Personal Navigator</a><a href="../configuration/">02 · Configuration</a><a href="../potential/" aria-current="page">03 · Potential</a></div><section class="pc-section"><p>Personal satisfaction rating: 0 means not satisfied at all, 10 means fully satisfied. Not a clinical scale. Fields may be left blank.</p><div class="pc-grid"><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">Physical</p><h3>Freedom of movement and comfort</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-0">Current</label><select id="pc-current-0" data-axis="physical" data-rating="current"><option value="">— Not rated</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-0">Desired</label><select id="pc-desired-0" data-axis="physical" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— Not rated</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">Potential</span><div class="pc-unknown">Not determined</div></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">Cognitive</p><h3>Clarity and sustained attention</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-1">Current</label><select id="pc-current-1" data-axis="cognitive" data-rating="current"><option value="">— Not rated</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-1">Desired</label><select id="pc-desired-1" data-axis="cognitive" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— Not rated</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">Potential</span><div class="pc-unknown">Not determined</div></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">Emotional</p><h3>Perceived calm and ease</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-2">Current</label><select id="pc-current-2" data-axis="emotional" data-rating="current"><option value="">— Not rated</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-2">Desired</label><select id="pc-desired-2" data-axis="emotional" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— Not rated</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">Potential</span><div class="pc-unknown">Not determined</div></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">Professional</p><h3>Comfort and resources during work</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-3">Current</label><select id="pc-current-3" data-axis="professional" data-rating="current"><option value="">— Not rated</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-3">Desired</label><select id="pc-desired-3" data-axis="professional" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— Not rated</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">Potential</span><div class="pc-unknown">Not determined</div></div></div></div></div><p class="pc-note">Potential is not calculated from the difference between current and desired states. It is explored through individual work.</p><div class="pc-actions"><button type="button" data-reset data-js hidden>Clear</button><button type="button" data-save data-js hidden>Save on your device</button></div><p class="pc-note">Selections are not retained after reloading and are not submitted automatically. Export creates a local JSON file.</p></section><section class="pc-section"><div class="pc-actions"><a class="pc-button primary" href="../start/">Discuss your individual enquiry</a></div></section></main>